<title>UK: CRICKET-BENSON AND HEDGES CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-BENSON AND HEDGES CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Benson and Hedges Cup</p>
<p>cricket matches on Tuesday:</p>
<p>At Derby: Warwickshire beat Derbyshire by one wicket.</p>
<p>Derbyshire 216-8 innings closed (C.Adams 61). Warwickshire 217-9</p>
<p>in 49.5 overs (N.Knight 69, D.Brown 58, V.Clarke 4-49).</p>
<p>At Lord's: Somerset beat Middlesex by 27 runs. Somerset</p>
<p>287-6 innings closed (P.Bowler 79, R.Harden 66, M.Burns 54).</p>
<p>Middlesex 260 in 48.1 overs (P.Weekes 77, S.Moffat 60).</p>
<p>At Bristol: Gloucestershire v Kent match abandoned. Kent</p>
<p>239-7 innings closed (G.Cowdrey 77). Gloucestershire 50-1 in</p>
<p>nine overs when rain stopped play.</p>
<p>At Downpatrick: Ireland v Essex - match abandoned due to</p>
<p>rain.</p>
<p>At Edinburgh: Scotland v Nottinghamshire - match abandoned,</p>
<p>rain.</p>
</text>
